opencode-manager-devcontainer

This product is a derived work based on opencode-manager (https://github.com/chriswritescode-dev/opencode-manager), which is licensed under the MIT License.

This product includes the devcontainers CLI (https://github.com/devcontainers/cli), licensed under the MIT License.

This product installs the following third-party components within the container image:
- Podman (Apache-2.0)
- crun (GPL-2.0)
- conmon (Apache-2.0)
- netavark (Apache-2.0)
- aardvark-dns (Apache-2.0)
- passt (GPL-2.0)
- fuse-overlayfs (GPL-3.0)
- catatonit (GPL-2.0)
- uidmap (GPL-2.0)